ttmp/2026/11/26/IRWB-007--specializing-candela-on-its-scene-data-partial-evaluation-over-constant-memory/design-doc/01-intern-guide-specializing-candela-on-its-scene-data-partial-evaluation-over-constant-memory.md:29:Summary: 'Intern guide for IRWB-007: Candela as an interpreter of its scene buffers, the host protocol and memory map, specialization as it exists, partial-evaluation background, a binding-time profile of all 18 scenes bounding the gain (monovariant at most 1.68x, polyvariant 2.1-4.5x on 11 scenes, below 1.7x on the 7 ray-marched ones), and a phased design: constant-memory facts, a checked host promise, load folding, versions, the BVH walk, The Trick, budgets and provenance.'
